{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":86,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祈求上帝施恩"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的祈禱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我貧窮困苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你垂聽我的禱告，應允我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你保護我的性命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我忠於你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的上帝，我信靠你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你拯救你的僕人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，我終日向你呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你憐憫我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，我的心仰望你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你賜僕人歡樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你良善仁慈，樂意赦免，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以豐盛的慈愛待一切求告你的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你聽我的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"垂聽我的懇求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"患難之時，我要向你呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你必應允我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，眾神明中沒有一位能與你相比，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的作為無與倫比。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你創造的萬國都要來敬拜你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將榮耀歸給你的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你偉大無比，行事奇妙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有你是上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你教我行你的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要行在你的真理中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你使我一心敬畏你的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主，我的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要全心讚美你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要永遠將榮耀歸給你的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你向我大施慈愛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從陰間深處救了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，狂傲的人起來攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一群兇殘之徒要殺害我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不把你放在眼裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但主啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是有憐憫和恩典的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不輕易發怒，充滿慈愛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無比信實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你垂顧我，憐憫我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賜力量給你的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救你婢女的兒子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你賜下恩待我的憑據，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使那些恨我的人見狀就抱愧蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你耶和華幫助我、安慰我。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/86.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/87.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/85.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}